  data: {
    LLM: "1. Standard trick-taking. Must follow suit. If unable, play any card or trump.\n2. Highest trump wins; if no trump, highest card of led suit wins.\n3. **Pass**: If everyone passes, a 'General Point-less' hand (Vuile) is played where the goal is simply to win as many tricks as possible, or a redeal occurs.",
